<title>USA: AMEX to list LEAPS on Lucent Tech Nov 18.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list LEAPS on Lucent Tech Nov 18.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Stock Exchange said Thursday it will list Long term Equity AnticiPation Securities, or LEAPS, on Lucent Technologies Inc Nov 18.</p>
<p>The exchange said the LEAPS would open with strike prices of 40, 50 and 60 and would have expirations in January 1998 and January 1999.</p>
<p>Lucent, which makes telecommunications equipment, was up 1/8 at 48-3/4 in Thursday afternoon trade.</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, 312-408 8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
